Members of the Innovation Advisory Committee,

My name is Ember Arlynx, and I am an independent researcher of formal methods
for software verification. I made my start in safety-critical systems and have
since worked as an engineer and scholar in the blockchain industry; I also do
research into machine consciousness. I participated in the seL4 formal
verification at the University of New South Wales, the world's first formally
verified operating system microkernel. I also developed zero-knowledge proof
